    "advancement": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>18th-level Holy feature</em></p><p>A guardian spirit watches over your allies. When a creature within 60 feet of you and is friendly to you drops to 0 hit points or is subjected to an effect that would make them die outright, such as the @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.dmvaMLFWFtv0qx0S]{power word kill} spell, you can use your reaction to summon this guardian spirit to them. The target is immediately returned to life and healed for half its hit point maximum. The target then gains immunity to all damage until the start of its next turn.</p><p>Once you use this feature, you can't use it again until you finish a long rest.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
